            "notes": "# Round 1 Notes \u2013 [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000)\ud83e\ude7a\n\n## Power Choice:\n\n-[Tactical Rifle](item_683d8145-a13e-4ea8-997b-0ed2151b1cac) \u2192 Scoped shots lock onto allies, guaranteeing heals from range.\n\n## Items:\n\n-[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) \u2192 [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) = stronger heals.\n\n-[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \u2192 [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) = faster heals.\n\n-[Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \u2192 Early survival vs dive.\n\n**Gameplan: Scope often to maximize reliable healing. High ground and cover are your best friends early.**",
